    m_Untranslated: "\u2022 In the Project view, navigate to <b>Assets/FPS/Prefabs/Level/Rooms</b>.\n\u2022 Click and drag the <b>Room_Altar</b> Prefab from the <b>Project window</b> onto the floor in the Scene view."
